  "notes": "Schematic, not a connector layout: pins read from the connector arrows at the schematic edges. Audio paths: 'OFF' INPUT through K contacts (NC side) to OUTPUT, 'ENERGIZED' INPUT through R1-R4 / R20-R23 to the NO side. DC CONTROL IN drives a 74C14/74C221 pull-in / drop-out delay and 2N3569 relay driver; DC CONTROL OUT is the relay coil low side. ENG MRW, CKD signature. Uses PCB 9-101."
